103
00:05:17.869 --> 00:05:19.767
Core Concepts, Beginner to Deep.

104
00:05:21.017 --> 00:05:23.449
Intuition: a doctor's consultation.

105
00:05:23.729 --> 00:05:26.801
A good doctor doesn't prescribe the moment you sit down.

106
00:05:27.081 --> 00:05:38.111
They ask the few questions that separate the likely conditions, take the measurements that matter, explain the options and their side effects, commit to a plan, and tell you what to watch for.

107
00:05:38.391 --> 00:05:40.716
A design interview is that consultation:

108
00:05:40.996 --> 00:05:42.767
The questions are requirements.

109
00:05:43.047 --> 00:05:44.753
The measurements are estimation.

110
00:05:45.033 --> 00:05:46.527
The options are trade-offs.

111
00:05:46.807 --> 00:05:48.257
The plan is the design.

112
00:05:49.607 --> 00:05:51.847
The warning signs are failure handling.

